=== Ending ===

You have gone too far, you wretched fiend. #speaker:Salesman #voice:Ending #cam:cam1

Ha ha… A fallen god like you still dares to look down on me? #speaker:The Anti-absolute Entity #voice:Ending #cam:cam2

Remember who it was that defeated you, The Absolute One. #speaker:The Anti-absolute Entity #voice:Ending #cam:cam2

You may have defeated me… but thanks to this brave soul’s resilience, I have regained my strength. #speaker:The Absolute One #voice:Ending #cam:cam1

Wait, what? How could that hero possibly reach this place?! #speaker:The Anti-absolute Entity #voice:Ending #cam:cam2

With the Sigils they have gathered and brought here. “O my power… rise once more!” #speaker:The Absolute One #voice:Ending #cam:cam1

No… no! How could an eternal god like me be defeated like this?! No… these wars… must not… be allowed to… end… Aaaahhhhh…! #speaker:The Anti-absolute Entity #voice:Ending #cam:cam2

-> END

=== Ending2 ===

Thank you for helping my friend. #speaker:The Absolute One #voice:Ending2

Because of you, this land has finally regained its long-lost peace. The people here will forever remember the great deeds you have done. #speaker:The Absolute One #voice:Ending2#speaker:The Absolute One #voice:Ending2

Ahead lies the gate to the heavens. Walk toward it, and you shall return to where you truly belong. #speaker:The Absolute One #voice:Ending2

Go now… and take pride in your achievements, O hero of “LOH.” #speaker:The Absolute One #voice:Ending2

-> END
